{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>朋友聚會時總為了誰先開始、誰負責付款而爭論不休？Inom Na 讓手機替大家作決定，全組把手指放在螢幕上，由程式隨機抽出人選、次序或分組，結果公平且可覆核。程式內置現成輪盤與 15 款派對遊戲，涵蓋真心話大冒險、從未做過、二選一等玩法，亦可自行編寫類別與卡牌，或從 inomna.com 加入免費內容包，適閤家庭聚會、朋友飯局與團隊聯誼時使用。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>手指抽籤與自訂輪盤</h2>\n<p>手指抽籤模式下，全組把手指按在螢幕上，程式隨機選出一人或排出先後次序。內置輪盤提供「誰先開始？」、「誰負責付款？」等選項，也可自建專屬輪盤。另有 15 款遊戲，包括真心話大冒險、從未做過與二選一，可完全離線遊玩，無帳戶、無廣告、無追蹤。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-150-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-151-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-152-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-153-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-154-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-155-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Inom Na</li>\n<li>應用類別：Entertainment</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-14T01:39:07.343787+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":367,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T09:56:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-14T01:32:41.484772+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-14T01:32:41.484772+00:00","content_hash":"2f9085e011cda74dbed7a763f8ea9891e476bd1425a3d62247894c7c6765b6e7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}